# Screen title bar

Pinned screen chrome (Settings, Add Exercises): use `ScreenTitleBar` from
`src/components/ScreenTitleBar.tsx`.

Gradient stops: `titleBarGradientColors` from `src/theme/titleBar.ts`
(`content-trans-light` → `bg-trans-1`). Do not redefine them in screens.

## Do not confuse with

| Component | Use |
|-----------|-----|
| `ScreenTitleBar` | Settings / Add Exercises — border, shadow, gradient fill; children = icons + title |
| `SessionTitleBar` / `TodaySessionTitleBar` | Workout homepage — date + session total |

Pass leading/trailing controls as children. Keep title typography at the call site.
